<view class="page {{_enter}}">
  <!-- 头部：汉堡转叉 -->
  <view class="mine-head">
    <view class="title h1">我的</view>
    <view class="ix-burger {{burgerOpen ? 'open' : ''}}" bindtap="onBurger">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 汉堡展开面板 -->
  <view class="burger-panel {{burgerOpen ? 'show' : ''}}" wx:if="{{burgerOpen}}">
    <view class="bp-item ix-tap" bindtap="goAbout">关于本应用</view>
    <view class="bp-item ix-tap danger" bindtap="onClearAll">清空全部数据</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 考试设置 -->
  <view class="section-title title">考试设置</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-row">
      <view class="form-label">考试日期</view>
      <picker mode="date" value="{{examDate}}" start="2026-01-01" end="2030-12-31" bindchange="onDateChange">
        <view class="form-picker">{{examDate || '请选择'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="form-row">
      <view class="form-label">每周时长</view>
      <picker range="{{hourOptions}}" value="{{hoursIndex}}" bindchange="onHoursChange">
        <view class="form-picker">{{hourOptions[hoursIndex]}} 小时/周</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="form-row">
      <view class="form-label">目标分数</view>
      <picker range="{{targetOptions}}" value="{{targetIndex}}" bindchange="onTargetChange">
        <view class="form-picker">{{targetOptions[targetIndex]}} 分</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="ix-ripple-host ix-spring btn-wrap" id="btn-save-profile" bindtouchstart="onRippleProfile">
      <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSaveProfile">保存设置</button>
      <view wx:for="{{ripplesProfile}}" wx:key="id" class="ix-ripple {{item.kind}}" style="left:{{item.left}}rpx;top:{{item.top}}rpx;width:{{item.size}}rpx;height:{{item.size}}rpx;"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="ix-ripple-host ix-spring btn-wrap" id="btn-regen" bindtouchstart="onRippleRegen">
      <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="onRegenerate">重新生成规划</button>
      <view wx:for="{{ripplesRegen}}" wx:key="id" class="ix-ripple {{item.kind}}" style="left:{{item.left}}rpx;top:{{item.top}}rpx;width:{{item.size}}rpx;height:{{item.size}}rpx;"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted xsmall" style="margin-top: 12rpx;">只有「考试日期」会改变排布；周时长/目标分/水平仅作你的起点记录，不影响排程。点上面按钮按新考试日期重排，手动添加的任务会保留。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 偏好：弹性开关 + 液态滑块 -->
  <view class="section-title title">学习偏好</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row pref-row">
      <view style="flex:1;">
        <view class="title">每日提醒</view>
        <view class="muted xsmall">完成打卡时申请订阅，到点推送今日任务</view>
      </view>
      <view class="ix-switch {{switchOn ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="onToggleSwitch"><view class="knob"></view></view>
    </view>

    <view class="pref-row" style="margin-top: 30rpx;">
      <view class="title">每日目标时长</view>
      <view class="gap"></view>
      <view class="muted small">{{dailyMin}} 分钟</view>
    </view>
    <view class="ix-slider" id="slider"
      bindtouchstart="onSliderStart" bindtouchmove="onSliderMove" bindtouchend="onSliderEnd">
      <view class="track"></view>
      <view class="fill" style="width:{{sliderPct}}%;"></view>
      <view class="knob" style="left:{{sliderPct}}%;"></view>
      <view class="sval">{{dailyMin}}′</view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted xsmall" style="margin-top: 12rpx;">记录你给自己的每日投入基准，作为进度复盘参考（不自动改变排程）。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 材料索引 -->
  <view class="section-title title">我的材料索引</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted xsmall">只登记名称与来源（指针），不存任何内容正文——题库/词库永远在你自己手里。</view>
    <view class="form-row">
      <view class="form-label">类型</view>
      <picker range="{{importTypes}}" value="{{importTypeIndex}}" bindchange="onImportTypeChange">
        <view class="form-picker">{{importTypes[importTypeIndex]}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="form-row">
      <view class="form-label">名称</view>
      <input class="form-input" value="{{newName}}" bindinput="onNewName" placeholder="如：刘晓燕48课 / 华研八合一" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-row">
      <view class="form-label">来源</view>
      <input class="form-input" value="{{newSource}}" bindinput="onNewSource" placeholder="可选：如 B站 / 纸质 / 网盘" />
    </view>
    <view class="ix-ripple-host ix-spring btn-wrap" id="btn-add" bindtouchstart="onRippleAdd">
      <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onAddImport">登记材料</button>
      <view wx:for="{{ripplesAdd}}" wx:key="id" class="ix-ripple {{item.kind}}" style="left:{{item.left}}rpx;top:{{item.top}}rpx;width:{{item.size}}rpx;height:{{item.size}}rpx;"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:for="{{imports}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="tag">{{item.type}}</view>
      <view style="margin-left: 16rpx; flex: 1;">
        <view>{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="muted xsmall" wx:if="{{item.source}}">{{item.source}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="del-link ix-tap" bindtap="onDeleteImport" data-id="{{item.id}}">删除</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 快捷绑定 -->
  <view class="section-title title">快捷操作</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted xsmall">把刘晓燕《你还在背单词吗》48 课的编号（U1L1–U12L4）按日期顺序绑到规划词汇任务上。只绑编号指针，不含任何单词内容。</view>
    <view class="ix-ripple-host ix-spring btn-wrap" id="btn-bind1" bindtouchstart="onRippleBind1">
      <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="onBindLessons">一键绑定刘晓燕48课</button>
      <view wx:for="{{ripplesBind1}}" wx:key="id" class="ix-ripple {{item.kind}}" style="left:{{item.left}}rpx;top:{{item.top}}rpx;width:{{item.size}}rpx;height:{{item.size}}rpx;"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted xsmall" style="margin-top: 16rpx;">按《细化计划表》把烤鸭TV听力课排期绑到听力任务：W1 主课 → W2–W3 八天训练营 → W4 起真题逐题解析 → 专项期华研分项轮换。</view>
    <view class="ix-ripple-host ix-spring btn-wrap" id="btn-bind2" bindtouchstart="onRippleBind2">
      <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="onBindKaoya">一键绑定烤鸭TV听力课</button>
      <view wx:for="{{ripplesBind2}}" wx:key="id" class="ix-ripple {{item.kind}}" style="left:{{item.left}}rpx;top:{{item.top}}rpx;width:{{item.size}}rpx;height:{{item.size}}rpx;"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 约束说明 -->
  <view class="section-title title">关于本应用</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted small">
      这是一款私人备考规划师：只负责倒计时、任务安排、进度追踪与复习提醒。
      应用内不含任何题目、试题、单词词库——所有学习内容由你自行录入或导入。
      任务里的"内容引用"只是指向你材料的备注，你的内容永远在你手里。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
